#: ../../index.rst:1
msgid ""
"Guidedog builds documentation websites and PDF books from "
"reStructuredText and Markdown."
msgstr "Guidedog 用 reStructuredText 和 Markdown 生成文档网站和 PDF 图书。"

#: ../../index.rst:5
msgid "Guidedog"
msgstr "Guidedog"

#: ../../index.rst:10
msgid "Write once. Explain well. Publish on the web and on paper."
msgstr "一次执笔，清晰阐述，同步呈现于网页与纸面。"

#: ../../index.rst:14
msgid ""
"Guidedog builds a documentation website and a PDF book from the same "
"reStructuredText or Markdown files. We write the text once. Guidedog "
"keeps the two editions in step."
msgstr ""
"Guidedog 从同一组 reStructuredText 或 Markdown 文件生成文档网站与 PDF "
"图书。文稿只需撰写一次，网页版与图书版由 Guidedog 自动保持一致。"

#: ../../index.rst:20
msgid ""
"`Read the manual <manual_>`_ `Download <download_>`_ `Source code "
"<source_>`_"
msgstr "`阅读手册 <manual_>`_ `下载 <download_>`_ `源代码 <source_>`_"

#: ../../index.rst:31
msgid ""
"A plain text file goes in. Guidedog makes a web page and a book page from "
"it."
msgstr "输入一份纯文本文件，Guidedog 即可同时生成网页与书页。"

#: ../../index.rst:34
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "功能概览"

#: ../../index.rst:39
msgid ""
"**A website.** Pages with navigation, search, highlighted code, and light "
"and dark themes, from Jinja templates we can change as much as we like."
msgstr "**网站。**\\ 页面自带导航、搜索、代码高亮及浅色与深色主题，基于可自由定制的 Jinja 模板生成。"

#: ../../index.rst:41
msgid ""
"**A PDF book.** Chapters, cross-references, figures, tables, footnotes, "
"and an index, set by Typst with hyphenation for each language."
msgstr "**PDF 图书。**\\ 包含章节、交叉引用、图、表、脚注和索引，由 Typst 按各语种排版规范精排。"

#: ../../index.rst:43
msgid ""
"**reStructuredText and Markdown.** Directives, roles, toctrees, and "
"cross-references work as Sphinx users expect, and MyST Markdown can sit "
"next to them."
msgstr ""
"**reStructuredText 与 Markdown。**\\ 指令、角色、目录树和交叉引用的用法符合 Sphinx 用户习惯，并可与 "
"MyST Markdown 混用。"

#: ../../index.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Translations.** Gettext catalogs carry a project into other languages. "
"Chinese, Japanese, Korean, and Hindi text is laid out correctly on screen "
"and on paper."
msgstr "**多语言翻译。**\\ 借助 gettext 消息目录将项目译为多种语言，中、日、韩及印地文在屏幕与纸面上均能正确排版。"

#: ../../index.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Diagrams, music, math, and API pages.** Graphviz and Typst diagrams, "
"LilyPond music notation, LaTeX equations, and API reference for Rust, "
"Python, and Odin, read from source code."
msgstr ""
"**图表、乐谱、公式与 API 页面。**\\ 支持 Graphviz 与 Typst 图表、LilyPond 乐谱、LaTeX "
"公式，以及直接从源码提取的 Rust、Python 和 Odin API 参考。"

#: ../../index.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Clear errors.** A message says what is wrong, where, and how to fix it. "
"A failed build leaves the last good site in place."
msgstr "**清晰的报错。**\\ 明确指出错误原因、所在位置及修复方法；构建失败时，上一版正常网站保持不变。"

#: ../../index.rst:52
msgid "One program"
msgstr "单一可执行文件"

#: ../../index.rst:55
msgid ""
"The release provides one ``guidedog`` executable with PDF typesetting, "
"diagram rendering, and music engraving included. We download the archive "
"for our system, unpack it, and start a project. On Windows we keep the "
"bundled runtime files beside the executable."
msgstr ""
"发行版仅包含一个 ``guidedog`` 可执行文件，内置 PDF 排版、图表渲染与乐谱排印功能。下载对应系统的归档包并解压，即可创建项目。在 "
"Windows 上，请将随附的运行时文件保留在可执行文件同级目录中。"

#: ../../index.rst:57
msgid ""
"Configuration is a TOML file. Templates are plain files in our project, "
"and we can edit them. The same command also manages static websites, "
"publishes to GitHub Pages, and keeps discussion records through its "
"linked ``ssg``, ``pages``, and ``dsc`` plugins."
msgstr ""
"配置是一个 TOML 文件。模板是项目中的普通文件，可以直接编辑。同一个命令还通过内置链接的 ``ssg``、``pages`` 和 "
"``dsc`` 插件管理静态网站、发布到 GitHub Pages 并维护讨论记录。"

#: ../../index.rst:60
msgid "Write it, see both"
msgstr "写一次，看两种结果"

#: ../../index.rst:63
msgid ""
"On the left is reStructuredText. On the right is what Guidedog made of it "
"on this page. The PDF builder sets the same lines as a book page."
msgstr ""
"左侧是 reStructuredText 源码，右侧是 Guidedog 在当前网页中的渲染效果；PDF 构建器会将同一段内容排印为书页。"

#: ../../index.rst:68
msgid ""
".. note::\n"
"\n"
"   Guidedog reads our text once.\n"
"\n"
"The *same* files become a **website**\n"
"and a **book**:\n"
"\n"
".. list-table::\n"
"   :header-rows: 1\n"
"\n"
"   * - Builder\n"
"     - Result\n"
"   * - ``html``\n"
"     - A website\n"
"   * - ``pdf``\n"
"     - A PDF book"
msgstr ""
".. note::\n"
"\n"
"   文稿只需由 Guidedog 读取一次。\n"
"\n"
"*同一组*\\ 源文件同时生成\\ **网站**\n"
"与\\ **图书**：\n"
"\n"
".. list-table::\n"
"   :header-rows: 1\n"
"\n"
"   * - 构建器\n"
"     - 结果\n"
"   * - ``html``\n"
"     - 网站\n"
"   * - ``pdf``\n"
"     - PDF 图书"

#: ../../index.rst:91
msgid "Guidedog reads our text once."
msgstr "文稿只需由 Guidedog 读取一次。"

#: ../../index.rst:93
msgid "The *same* files become a **website** and a **book**:"
msgstr "*同一组*\\ 源文件同时生成\\ **网站**\\ 与\\ **图书**："

#: ../../index.rst:99
msgid "Builder"
msgstr "构建器"

#: ../../index.rst:100
msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

#: ../../index.rst:101
msgid "``html``"
msgstr "``html``"

#: ../../index.rst:102
msgid "A website"
msgstr "网站"

#: ../../index.rst:103
msgid "``pdf``"
msgstr "``pdf``"

#: ../../index.rst:104
msgid "A PDF book"
msgstr "PDF 图书"

#: ../../index.rst:108
msgid ""
"The `manual as a PDF book <manual-pdf_>`_ is an example of the result on "
"paper. It is built from the same files as the manual's website."
msgstr "`PDF 版手册 <manual-pdf_>`_\\ 展示了纸面排版效果，它与手册网站由同一组源文件生成。"

#: ../../index.rst:112
msgid "Get started"
msgstr "开始使用"

#: ../../index.rst:115
msgid ""
"Download the archive for our system from the `latest release "
"<download_>`_, put ``guidedog`` on the ``PATH``, and create a project:"
msgstr ""
"从\\ `最新发布版本 <download_>`_\\ 下载对应系统的归档包，将 ``guidedog`` 加入 ``PATH``，即可创建项目："

#: ../../index.rst:118
msgid ""
"guidedog quickstart docs\n"
"guidedog build html docs\n"
"guidedog build pdf docs\n"
"guidedog serve docs"
msgstr ""
"guidedog quickstart docs\n"
"guidedog build html docs\n"
"guidedog build pdf docs\n"
"guidedog serve docs"

#: ../../index.rst:125
msgid ""
"``quickstart`` writes ``conf.toml``, ``index.rst``, and templates we can "
"edit. ``serve`` rebuilds the site while we write. The `tutorial "
"<manual-tutorial_>`_ walks through a first project. To build Guidedog "
"from source, install Rust and follow the `instructions in the repository "
"<build_>`_."
msgstr ""
"``quickstart`` 会生成 ``conf.toml``、``index.rst`` 及可自由修改的模板；``serve`` "
"会在写作过程中自动重建网站。`入门教程 <manual-tutorial_>`_\\ 将一步步带你完成首个项目。如需从源码构建 "
"Guidedog，请安装 Rust 并参照\\ `仓库构建说明 <build_>`_\\ 操作。"

#: ../../index.rst:131
msgid "Design discussions"
msgstr "设计讨论"

#: ../../index.rst:134
msgid ""
"Guidedog's design decisions are written down as numbered discussions: the "
"problem, the alternatives, the decision, and the evidence. We can read "
"each one on the web or download it as a PDF."
msgstr ""
"Guidedog 的各项设计决策均沉淀为编号讨论记录，涵盖问题背景、备选方案、最终决策与验证依据。每篇记录既可在网页端阅读，也可下载 PDF 版本。"

#: ../../index.rst:138
msgid ""
"Our own project can keep its discussions the same way, with ``guidedog "
"dsc``. The `manual <manual-discussions_>`_ shows how."
msgstr ""
"借助 ``guidedog dsc``，你的项目也可以用同样的方式维护设计讨论，具体用法详见\\ `手册说明 "
"<manual-discussions_>`_。"

#: ../../index.rst:142
msgid "`Read the discussions <discussions_>`_"
msgstr "`阅读设计讨论 <discussions_>`_"

